{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1455704-inspiration-for-lost-boys-and-lost-girls","id":1455704,"title":"Inspiration for Lost Boys and Lost Girls","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-27T23:55:27-07:00","id":1455704,"title":"Inspiration for Lost Boys and Lost Girls","content":"In a previous dialogue, I had shared my hope that changeling 2e will continue with the theme it introduced with <i>Summertime Sam; </i> changelings who are trapped in eternal childhood. On youtube, I found some videos I think can be a good source of inspiration for developing chronicles that focus on these characters. The first ones I want to introduce are play throughs from Fran Brow.<br /> <br /> Set in 1944, the game tells the story of Fran, a ten-year-old girl struggling with mental illness after witnessing the violent murder of her parents. After being found alone in the woods, Fran is admitted to Oswald Asylum and separated from her black cat and only friend, Mr. Midnight. Under the care of psychiatrist Dr. Marcel Deern, Fran is administered pills. The pills cause vivid hallucinations of a phantasmagoric parallel universe, filling the Oswald Asylum with smears of blood, mysterious messages, grisly torture, human subject research in psychology and neurology, and otherworldly shadow beings. Driven to escape her imprisonment, find her cat and return home. Fran eventually finds her cat in the house of two evil conjoined twins. Fran eventually escapes them and comes across a bridge, from which she falls, after which Fran passes into an another world. Still searching for an explanation of her parents' murder, Fran finds herself transformed into a tree in a world called Ithersta, a land where vegetables, insects, pine cones, and roots live in harmony. After departing Ithersta, she encounters a giant skeletal creature named Itward. Fran finds out that it was Itward who helped her in her search for her cat. Itward then tries to take Fran back home in his flying machine.<br /> Throughout the game, Fran and other characters grapple with psychological trauma, survive the abuse of parents and doctors, and learn what it means to live amongst other humans and spirits.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Escaping the Asylum || Fran Bow #1 (Chapter 1 Playthrough) - YouTube<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YSHdQlQhW5o&amp;t=1s\" target=\"_blank\">Escaping the Asylum || Fran Bow #1 (Chapter 1 Playthrough) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> Freeing the Twisted Twins || Fran Bow #2 (Chapter 2 - Playthrough) - YouTube<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fXJP2sf_NE4&amp;t=18s\" target=\"_blank\">Freeing the Twisted Twins || Fran Bow #2 (Chapter 2 - Playthrough) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> Returning Fran to Human Form || Fran Bow #3 (Chapter 3 - Playthrough) - YouTube<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WkKsisS7HP4&amp;t=2s\" target=\"_blank\">Returning Fran to Human Form || Fran Bow #3 (Chapter 3 - Playthrough) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> Little Airship of Horrors || Fran Bow #4 (Chapter 4 - Playthrough) - YouTube<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tzm-RVW5M3o&amp;t=1s\" target=\"_blank\">Little Airship of Horrors || Fran Bow #4 (Chapter 4 - Playthrough) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-28T00:11:12-07:00","id":1455706,"title":"","content":"Another series that can be a source of inspiration is I Hate Fairyland! I Hate Fairyland is a black comedy that follows Gertrude, a woman who was transported to a mystical world called Fairyland as a child. Thirty years later, Gertrude is now an un-aging, violent misanthrope who, alongside her reluctant guide and friend Larry, constantly tries and fails to return to the real world.<br /> The plot starts with Gertrude falling into Fairyland as a ten-year-old. She spends 27 years looking for the key to escape with her insect sidekick Larry, but never ages, resulting in her becoming a violent sociopath\u2026..<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a8YqzYHixyc\" target=\"_blank\">I HATE Fairyland! Comic Dub Episode 1 - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Kqz-hojMtc\" target=\"_blank\">I HATE Fairyland! Comic Dub Episode 2 - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=218hXmcwnBU\" target=\"_blank\">I HATE Fairyland! Comic Dub Episode 3 - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xg6lc3VjG08\" target=\"_blank\">I HATE Fairyland! Comic Dub Episode 4 - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-28T11:26:01-07:00","id":1455724,"title":"","content":"Here is the last chapter from Fran Bow. I hope to put up <i>The Child Thief,</i> next.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=49Lf03yO3fk\" target=\"_blank\">Uncovering the Terrible Truth || Fran Bow #5 (Chapter 5 - Playthrough ENDING) - YouTube</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-28T12:06:07-07:00","id":1455726,"title":"","content":"Here is the last section of part 1 of <i><b>I hate fairyland.</b></i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=swlF7LaDY-s\" target=\"_blank\">I HATE Fairyland Comic Dub Episode 5 SEASON 1 FINALE - YouTube</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-28T16:05:12-07:00","id":1455732,"title":"","content":"The Child Thief is a DARK modern retelling of Peter Pan, which draws heavily on Celtic Fae lore. It is also a good source of inspiration for a Changeling: The Lost game, because both the Lost Boys and Pirates/Protestants are very similar to changelings from Changeling: The Lost. They are transformed into fae type creatures and given magical powers by eating fae food. Darklings are also mentioned in the story.<br /> <br /> <br /> Here are parts 1 and 2:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uDNTyOAQppY&amp;t=29564s\" target=\"_blank\">The Child Thief Audiobooks #1 by Brom - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kxtlzrz6SKA&amp;t=24692s\" target=\"_blank\">The Child Thief Audiobooks #2 by Brom - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-29T18:28:22-07:00","id":1455774,"title":"","content":"If you've ever seen Jeff Lemire's Black Hammer comics, one of the characters is Golden Gail, a Golden Age/1940s superhero based on the original Captain Marvel. While she has aged normally, her superpowered form is perpetually 9 years old. Because the characters are trapped in a mysterious small town limbo and she's stuck in her child form, this causes a lot of issues and bitterness for her. <br /> <br /> Also the 2009 film Orphan, to a degree, and certain parts of Interview with the Vampire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-29T19:23:01-07:00","id":1455775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1455704-inspiration-for-lost-boys-and-lost-girls?p=1455774#post1455774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you've ever seen Jeff Lemire's Black Hammer comics, one of the characters is Golden Gail, a Golden Age/1940s superhero based on the original Captain Marvel. While she has aged normally, her superpowered form is perpetually 9 years old. Because the characters are trapped in a mysterious small town limbo and she's stuck in her child form, this causes a lot of issues and bitterness for her.<br /> <br /> Also the 2009 film Orphan, to a degree, and certain parts of Interview with the Vampire.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Interview with a vampire partially sparked the idea in my head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-29T19:42:20-07:00","id":1455777,"title":"","content":"I hope people have had a chance to look over the entries and they have sparked some chronicle ideas.<br /> <br /> There is a game series whose universe I feel accurately portrays the madness of arcadia and takes themes from our world and twists them into horrifying nightmares and that is the series <b><i>Little Nightmares. </i></b>It takes mundane themes and shows them through the eyes of abused children. <br /> Because it is actually the first game here are gameplay from the chapters of <b><i>Little Nightmares 2.</i></b><br /> <b><i>Chapter 1</i></b><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-7W8l5Jbsxc&amp;t=16s\" target=\"_blank\">Little Nightmares II - Chapter 1 &quot;Wilderness&quot; | Full PS5 Walkthrough Gameplay 60 FPS (No Commentary) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <b><i>Chapter 2</i></b><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Beub_BumwD4\" target=\"_blank\">Little Nightmares II - Chapter 2 &quot;School&quot; | Full PS5 Walkthrough Gameplay 60FPS (No Commentary) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <b><i>Chapter 3</i></b><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4sgZPOzLu5s\" target=\"_blank\">Little Nightmares II - Chapter 3 &quot;Hospital&quot; | Full PS5 Walkthrough Gameplay 60FPS (No Commentary) - YouTube</a><br /> <b><i>Chapter 4</i></b><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0HQ07kwq_Zo\" target=\"_blank\">Little Nightmares II - Chapter 4 | Full PS5 Walkthrough Gameplay 60FPS (No Commentary) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <b><i>Chapter 5</i></b><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=othNf_2Qpl4\" target=\"_blank\">Little Nightmares II - Chapter 5 | Full PS5 Walkthrough Gameplay 60FPS (No Commentary) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> Story and ending explained.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v7kiHLU1Mkw\" target=\"_blank\">Little Nightmares 2: The Story &amp; All Endings Explained (Horror Game Theories) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-30T21:07:18-07:00","id":1455835,"title":"","content":"In a Changeling chronicle that included a <i>Lost Boy/Lost Girl </i>or even a motley of <i>Lost Boys </i>I think it would be interesting to explore how they survive. Because of child labor laws, they would have difficulty finding a source of income. Plus, people will eventually notice that they do not age. A series that could be a great source of inspiration is an old Japanese manga titled Chairudo. The series is about a race of beings with the appearance of children, but possess superpowers like mutants from Marvel's X-Men series.<br /> <br /> You can read the first 17 chapters here.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://w11.mangafreak.net/Manga/Chairudo\" target=\"_blank\">Chairudo Manga Chapter List - MangaFreak</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-31T21:16:46-07:00","id":1455898,"title":"","content":"I wanted to give another example of how to play/portray a <i>Lost Boy/Lost Girl </i>in a more heroic, noble, even innocent way. So here is the game play of <i><b>Little Misfortune.</b></i> Though some people might disagree with me, I feel <i><b>Fran Brow</b></i> and <i><b>Little Misfortune </b></i>have a very strong <i><b>Changeling: The Lost</b></i> tone to them.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nc7BtTyuvms&amp;t=397s\" target=\"_blank\">Little Misfortune - Good Choices - Full Game Walkthrough Gameplay &amp; Ending (No Commentary) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-04T10:59:56-07:00","id":1456143,"title":"","content":"Another series that I feel does a good job of showing how an adult trapped in the body of a child is the series, Serial, which tells the story of Joe, a fifty year old woman trapped in the body of a ten year old girl. Joe has been kept young by a demon which also turned her into a serial killer. Finally freed from the demons influence, Zoe returns home to find her best friend murdered. Now, Zoe uses her skills and appearance to stalk the predator and avenge her friend.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://readcomicsonline.ru/comic/serial-2021/1\" target=\"_blank\">Serial (2021-) Chapter 1 - Page 1 (readcomicsonline.ru)</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-11T18:25:36-07:00","id":1456632,"title":"","content":"Here is the full gameplay of <b><i>From Among the Sleep. </i></b>I believe that <i><b>From Among the Sleep</b></i> and the <i><b>Little Nightmares</b></i> series can be good inspiration for a True Fae and realm in Arcadia that represents the childhood fears and child abuse.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dphz3i4WY04\" target=\"_blank\">Childhood Nightmares || Among the Sleep #1 (Playthrough) - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uyKJk1PGf74\" target=\"_blank\">Dark Secrets and Chilling Truths || Among the Sleep #2 (Playthrough ENDING &amp; DLC) - YouTube</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-31T19:33:18-07:00","id":1458206,"title":"","content":"I found a music video for <b><i>Little Nightmares 2</i></b> as well as a video describing the many monsters in the game.<br /> <br /> I genuinely think they can provide inspiration for a chronicle the focuses on lost boys/lost girls and hobgoblins born from the nightmares of children.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Z5I1ydmSUE\" target=\"_blank\">(2) LITTLE NIGHTMARES 2 RAP by JT Music (feat. Andrea Storm Kaden) - &quot;Nightmares Never End&quot; - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZnE4lMYa2yE\" target=\"_blank\">(2) All Monsters in Little Nightmares 2 Explained - YouTube</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-01T17:39:55-07:00","id":1458278,"title":"","content":"I realize that I had shown the full gameplay of little nightmares 2, but not little nightmares 1.<br /> <br /> So here it is.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJ6Jcftf-c4\" target=\"_blank\">(2) Little Nightmares Gameplay Walkthrough FULL GAME (no commentary) - YouTube</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-05T19:58:12-07:00","id":1458915,"title":"","content":"A game that I think can give a good source of inspiration for developing/playing a Lost Boy/Lost Girl as a loyalist is <b><i>The Witches House. </i></b>But what I find really interesting about the game is being given someone else\u2019s\u2019 identity. For example, what if you made a deal with your Keeper that they gave you the identity of another person. Not just their appearance, but name, family, home, and personal connections. <b><i>The Witches House </i></b>really develops that idea.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VHIzL7Jb2Xs&amp;t=6s\" target=\"_blank\">(2) The Witch's House STORY &amp; ENDING EXPLAINED - YouTube</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-06T20:38:01-07:00","id":1459094,"title":"","content":"Here is #1 of a discontinued comic, <b><i>Never Never,</i></b> that gives ideas on how to portray Peter Pan as evil and ideas for Lost Boy characters.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://readcomicsonline.ru/comic/never-never-2020/1\" target=\"_blank\">Never Never (2020-) Chapter 1 - Page 1 (readcomicsonline.ru)</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactio